1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,600
In the middle of the South Pacific

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:05,200
lies Point Nemo.

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:07,400
The most isolated place on Earth.

4
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:10,200
The closest humans aren't on land...

5
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:13,500
they're aboard the Space Station, orbiting above.

6
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:16,800
In the summer of 1997,

7
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:20,400
NOAA's deep-sea microphones detected something impossible.

8
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:23,800
An ultra-low frequency sound rising from the depths.

9
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:27,200
It was detected across three thousand miles.

10
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:29,400
Louder than a blue whale.

11
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:31,500
Scientists called it "The Bloop".

12
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:34,500
What do you think made that sound?
